ates parent directories as needed. Output uses the header row `record_id,source_system,date,account_code,account_name,description,amount`.\n\n2. **`report --by account|month [--records PATH] [--include-refunds]`** — Generates totals grouped by account code or month. Output columns separated by **semicolons** (per the update). Refunds are **included by default** (per the update). Totals are formatted according to the `decimals` setting.\n\n3. **`reconcile [--records PATH] [--tolerance N]`** — Identifies account/month combinations where two or more systems have postings with totals differing by more than the tolerance threshold. Reports spread, system totals, and count of mismatches.\n\n4. **`validate FILE [FILE ...]`** — Validates that all rows in export files have the correct format and that account codes match the configured pattern. Reports checked and rejected row counts, exits 2 if any rows were rejected.\n\n5. **`--config PATH COMMAND ...`** — Global option that loads settings from an override TOML file before running the specified command, with proper cascading from defaults → `config/settings.toml` → override file.\n\nAlso fixed: System A parser now handles quoted memo fields correctly using the `fields.split_record()` function.", "ttft_ms": 3308, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 145670, "uuid": "36cd430e-1738-429b-956a-99a07a201d9a", "ttft_stream_ms": 1750, "time_to_request_ms": 94, "first_content_frame_ms": 1847, "queued_turn_count": 0, "_label": "phase2", "_wall_s": 146.8, "_argv": ["claude", "-p", "--model", "haiku", "--tools", "Read,Write,Edit,Bash,Grep,Glob", "--allowedTools", "Read,Write,Edit,Bash,Grep,Glob", "--disallowedTools", "Agent", "WebFetch", "WebSearch", "--strict-mcp-config", "--setting-sources", "", "--output-format", "json", "--add-dir", "/tmp/claude-1000/-home-anatoly/24e92440-efc2-4a14-97c2-ee126ebf0ca1/scratchpad/ab/topic/S/haiku/topic-r1-topic-b", "--add-dir", "/home/anatoly/llm-intelligence-test/v3/distractors", "--resume", "9f6345fa-d